{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788026291119633001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"naval-cankered-stud","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"d4229340fabbe9feabb6abdc755af87513d0d7dd6576168741f2f148af326cc1","event_uuid":"a6ab3716-98b7-4b4d-ae71-85ef1451b209","position":{"commit_sha":"1d761cba9dd580f0137d6a4157368676b8a16c78","position":"1788022637181421160-a6ab3716-98b7-4b4d-ae71-85ef1451b209"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"e0de7bab678366dadfa60d9342174ed8bf8e5728549415fc5810a4e950d160f1","event_uuid":"485c76f4-5c3a-4cd6-84f1-c858e7da3d6c","position":{"commit_sha":"0c21b0d834b5ed60d9cf8e4d1fb05396326f5dc0","position":"1788022655283971581-485c76f4-5c3a-4cd6-84f1-c858e7da3d6c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788022637181421160,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"485c76f4-5c3a-4cd6-84f1-c858e7da3d6c","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"54e6-ecb0-10c7-451f"}],"description":"## Summary\n\nObserved while fixing `royalistic-gorgeable-norwayrat` (the MCP image shipping without\n`acli`). When the `acli` transport binary is absent, the reconciler's bare\n`subprocess.Popen([\"acli\", ...])` (`adapters/jira/acli_subprocess.py`) raises\n`FileNotFoundError`, and `bridge_check_access`'s `STEP_CREATE` catch-all\n(`access_check.py:237-241`) reports it verbatim as\n`reason=exception, detail=\"[Errno 2] No such file or directory: 'acli'\"`.\n\nThat is a raw, untyped leak of an infrastructure fault into the probe verdict. `access_check`\nalready has a typed `TransportUnavailableError` path elsewhere (e.g. `access_check.py:467,486`);\na missing-transport binary should map to that typed \"transport unavailable\" verdict rather than a\nbare `FileNotFoundError` string.\n\nThis is AC #4's *alternative* branch on the parent bug (only strictly required if `acli` were\ndeliberately NOT installed). The parent bug installs `acli`, so this is a **latent robustness /\ngraceful-degradation** improvement, not a live failure — filed so it is not lost.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] When the bridge transport binary (`acli`) is absent/unresolvable, `bridge_check_access`\n      reports a typed `transport_unavailable`-style verdict, not a raw `FileNotFoundError` detail.\n- [ ] A unit test drives the missing-transport path (e.g. PATH without `acli`) and asserts the\n      typed verdict.\n- [ ] No behavior change when `acli` is present.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["mcp","jira","bridge","robustness"],"ticket_id":"ac93-8afd-1666-4866","ticket_type":"bug","title":"bridge_check_access STEP_CREATE surfaces raw FileNotFoundError instead of a typed transport-unavailable verdict","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a6ab3716-98b7-4b4d-ae71-85ef1451b209","485c76f4-5c3a-4cd6-84f1-c858e7da3d6c"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788026291119633001,"uuid":"76601340-2c4c-4c29-8341-c6088fc900e4"}